= TemplateStyles End-to-End Test =

This page transcludes a template that loads its own CSS subpage.

== Live examples ==
* {{TestTemplate}}
* {{TestTemplate|Custom label from test page}}
* {{TestTemplate|tone=success|Success state}}
* {{TestTemplate|tone=warning|Warning state}}
* {{TestTemplate|tone=danger|Danger state}}

== What this verifies ==
# The page can transclude the template.
# The template loads <templatestyles src="TestTemplate/styles.css" />.
# The CSS classes from the subpage style the output.
